    "mode": "resolved",
    "title": "Older man fined for trading child sex abuse images",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2004-01-29",
    "body": "On 29 January 2004 the North Shore District Court sentenced an older man for trading child sex abuse images on the Internet. He was ordered to pay fines and costs totalling $6,750. He was put on supervision for 24 months, during which he must attend a sex offender treatment programme. The Court ordered forfeiture and destruction of his computer and objectionable material."
  },
  {
    "source_url": "https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/af5d7e28345a1a16cc256e2a000b7c10!OpenDocument",
    "mode": "resolved",
    "title": "18-year-old fined for trading child sex abuse images",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2004-01-29",
    "body": "On 29 January 2004 the North Shore District Court sentenced an 18-year-old, who was granted name suppression, for trading child sex abuse images on the Internet. He was ordered to pay fines and costs totalling $960. He was put on supervision for 24 months, during which he must attend a sex offender treatment programme. The Court ordered forfeiture and destruction of his computer and objectionable material."
  },
  {
    "source_url": "https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/f7b11b777b1563cfcc256e2d0073422a!OpenDocument",
    "mode": "resolved",
    "title": "23-year-old fined for collecting child sex abuse images",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2004-01-30",
    "body": "On 30 January 2004 the Manukau District Court fined a 23-year-old $12,000 on 15 charges of collecting child sex abuse images. The brothers had collected 196 objectionable images and one objectionable video of adults sexually abusing a young girl and of children aged between seven and 10."
  },
  {
    "source_url": "https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/f7b11b777b1563cfcc256e2d0073422a!OpenDocument",
    "mode": "resolved",
    "title": "24-year-old fined for collecting child sex abuse images",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2004-01-30",
    "body": "The Manukau District Court fined a 24-year-old $4,500 on nine charges of collecting child sex abuse images in July 2003. The brothers had collected 196 objectionable images and one objectionable video of adults sexually abusing a young girl and of children aged between seven and 10. He pleaded guilty."
  },
