    "title": "55-year-old jailed for child sexual exploitation",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2024-07-29",
    "body": "On 26 July 2024 at Invercargill District Court a 55-year-old man was sentenced to 4 years imprisonment after pleading guilty to one count of indecent act on a child, one representative charge of possession and one representative charge of distribution of objectionable material depicting the sexual exploitation and abuse of children. A search found over 400 images depicting the sexual exploitation and abuse of infants and young children."
  },
  {
    "source_url": "https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/7bee2b57c11c3d63cc258b680079e7e3!OpenDocument",
    "mode": "resolved",
    "title": "53-year-old jailed for child sexual exploitation",
    "byline": "",
    "pub_date": "2024-07-29",
    "body": "On 26 July 2024 at Invercargill District Court a 53-year-old man was sentenced to 4 years and 3 months imprisonment after pleading guilty to one representative charge of possession and one representative charge of distribution of objectionable material depicting the sexual exploitation and abuse of children, and one charge of indecent act on a child."
  },
